    <!-- Description -->
    <Description>Ablative plate that burns away in layers, so the first hits fall on plating and not on the crew. The Union has plenty of plate and fewer ships than it needs. Strong protection against kinetic rounds, beams, energy fire and explosions, good protection against plasma. Of the Cardassian ship plates of its size, it is the toughest and the best protected against beams, but the costliest to build.</Description>
